    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3103640/extras/0bce3c7f8c3f3ca469b1f4adf2451ce0.webp?t=1753556925\" width=508 height=48 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try all the armory in one go. Shoot, throw, pick another one. Destroy enemies with various guns from not-so-boring pistols to void cannons (what the hell even is that?!).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3103640/extras/47dbec3e344f4eeaffac0f2987f65bb5.poster.avif?t=1753556925\" width=800 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3103640/extras/47dbec3e344f4eeaffac0f2987f65bb5.webm?t=1753556925\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3103640/extras/47dbec3e344f4eeaffac0f2987f65bb5.mp4?t=1753556925\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3103640/extras/68459140ae3060963b4a0a1487a96304.webp?t=1753556925\" width=508 height=48 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is offensive, protective and supportive magic for all possible cases. Fireballs, electricity rays, void shields and flying summoned guns are just a small part of it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3103640/extras/1b8785cb5b8b14626975d9a41cb6071a.poster.avif?t=1753556925\" width=800 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3103640/extras/1b8785cb5b8b14626975d9a41cb6071a.webm?t=1753556925\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3103640/extras/1b8785cb5b8b14626975d9a41cb6071a.mp4?t=1753556925\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3103640/extras/604f8f12848653cbb9b0904da994f2ff.webp?t=1753556925\" width=508 height=48 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The colossal Mother Drone \u2013 surrounded by a minion swarm, bristling with rocket launchers, and sporting a giant laser eye \u2013 is waiting for you. And this is just your first boss. Imagine the nightmares waiting down the line!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3103640/extras/985c194033531733853f31d8fc90214c.poster.avif?t=1753556925\" width=800 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3103640/extras/985c194033531733853f31d8fc90214c.webm?t=1753556925\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3103640/extras/985c194033531733853f31d8fc90214c.mp4?t=1753556925\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3103640/extras/991aee1b75431d20872469d937d85acd.webp?t=1753556925\" width=508 height=48 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eyes on the alarm as bullets fly. Blast hordes one-handed while hacking with the other. Every arena throws fresh twists your way \u2013 stay ready.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3103640/extras/e81f1f5d64945c964c30a7bc30bd3081.poster.avif?t=1753556925\" width=800 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3103640/extras/e81f1f5d64945c964c30a7bc30bd3081.webm?t=1753556925\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3103640/extras/e81f1f5d64945c964c30a7bc30bd3081.mp4?t=1753556925\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3103640/extras/9e3dd30c221e4639787626c106bbee2b.webp?t=1753556925\" width=508 height=48 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Splatter waves of bandits, corpos, droids, warlocks, and every other low-life across the walls. Don\u2019t let their coordinated strikes, busted abilities, or sheer numbers overwhelm you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3103640/extras/5ab408eb662c791f5c91950020adf969.webp?t=1753556925\" width=508 height=48 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Leap into an on-rails shooter drenched in cyber-magic. A chatty sidekick stuck in a drone shell, corporate sorcerers, and nonstop insanity await \u2013 go raise havoc in this mad world!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3103640/extras/0bce3c7f8c3f3ca469b1f4adf2451ce0.webp?t=1753556925\" width=508 height=48 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try all the armory in one go. Shoot, throw, pick another one. Destroy enemies with various guns from not-so-boring pistols to void cannons (what the hell even is that?!).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3103640/extras/47dbec3e344f4eeaffac0f2987f65bb5.poster.avif?t=1753556925\" width=800 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3103640/extras/47dbec3e344f4eeaffac0f2987f65bb5.webm?t=1753556925\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3103640/extras/47dbec3e344f4eeaffac0f2987f65bb5.mp4?t=1753556925\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3103640/extras/68459140ae3060963b4a0a1487a96304.webp?t=1753556925\" width=508 height=48 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is offensive, protective and supportive magic for all possible cases. Fireballs, electricity rays, void shields and flying summoned guns are just a small part of it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3103640/extras/1b8785cb5b8b14626975d9a41cb6071a.poster.avif?t=1753556925\" width=800 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3103640/extras/1b8785cb5b8b14626975d9a41cb6071a.webm?t=1753556925\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3103640/extras/1b8785cb5b8b14626975d9a41cb6071a.mp4?t=1753556925\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3103640/extras/604f8f12848653cbb9b0904da994f2ff.webp?t=1753556925\" width=508 height=48 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The colossal Mother Drone \u2013 surrounded by a minion swarm, bristling with rocket launchers, and sporting a giant laser eye \u2013 is waiting for you. And this is just your first boss. Imagine the nightmares waiting down the line!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3103640/extras/985c194033531733853f31d8fc90214c.poster.avif?t=1753556925\" width=800 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3103640/extras/985c194033531733853f31d8fc90214c.webm?t=1753556925\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3103640/extras/985c194033531733853f31d8fc90214c.mp4?t=1753556925\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3103640/extras/991aee1b75431d20872469d937d85acd.webp?t=1753556925\" width=508 height=48 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eyes on the alarm as bullets fly. Blast hordes one-handed while hacking with the other. Every arena throws fresh twists your way \u2013 stay ready.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3103640/extras/e81f1f5d64945c964c30a7bc30bd3081.poster.avif?t=1753556925\" width=800 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3103640/extras/e81f1f5d64945c964c30a7bc30bd3081.webm?t=1753556925\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3103640/extras/e81f1f5d64945c964c30a7bc30bd3081.mp4?t=1753556925\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3103640/extras/9e3dd30c221e4639787626c106bbee2b.webp?t=1753556925\" width=508 height=48 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Splatter waves of bandits, corpos, droids, warlocks, and every other low-life across the walls. Don\u2019t let their coordinated strikes, busted abilities, or sheer numbers overwhelm you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3103640/extras/5ab408eb662c791f5c91950020adf969.webp?t=1753556925\" width=508 height=48 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Leap into an on-rails shooter drenched in cyber-magic. A chatty sidekick stuck in a drone shell, corporate sorcerers, and nonstop insanity await \u2013 go raise havoc in this mad world!</p>",
    "short_description": "An arcade cyberpunk VR action shooter. Try all the armory in one go: shoot, throw, pick another one. Cast spectacular spells. Fight badass bosses and be badass yourself. Even deflect death rays with trash can lids!",
    "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Russian<strong>*</strong>, French, German, Spanish - Spain, Simplified Chinese, Korean, Polish, Portuguese - Portugal, Japanese<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support",
